    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;From November 16-20, Good Women will be hosting classes with Anne-Marie Jourdenais of MAYDAY Danse (Montréal). The classes incorporate elements of Action Theatre, a technique that allows the artist to evolve and let go of habits, limits and fears. Using her background in Qi Gong, Ms. Jourdenais helps ...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
