    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Love Fail is an exciting new collaboration between GWDC, Pro Coro Canada and New Music Edmonton. The score, created by Pulitzer-prize winning composer David Lang and directed by Pro Coro Canada’s Artistic Director Michael Zaugg, is a modern retelling of Tristan and Isolde which interweaves details of the timeless ...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
